pystaple
========

pystaple is a Python translation of parts of the STAPLE MATLAB toolbox
(Shared Tools for Automatic Personalised Lower Extremity modelling):

    STAPLE, Copyright (c) 2020-2021 Modenese L., Renault J.-B.
    https://github.com/modenaxe/msk-STAPLE
    Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0
    International License (CC BY-NC 4.0).

STAPLE includes GIBOC-core, a minimal version of the GIBOC-knee toolbox by
Renault J.-B. et al. (https://github.com/renaultJB/GIBOC-Knee-Coordinate-System),
and the function lscylinder.m from the NPL Least Squares Geometric Elements
library; the corresponding parts of pystaple are translations of that code.

